  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "56e7a020339f079f",
      "text": "I've got a record on. Three minutes and forty seconds, so talk fast.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 317,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "open"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0772acf7684b121e",
      "text": "You again. Song and a half this time.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 318,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "open"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3dd0d7b88a382fe9",
      "text": "Lights, mostly. Cattle, some nights. Engines.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 322,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "calls"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "073fce364994cf9e",
      "text": "And missing time. You read that book? Everybody's read that book now.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 323,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "calls"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3a345d802b2c405b",
      "text": "Half of them, I think they read it first and then it happened to them.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 324,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "calls"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f60bda199fff5103",
      "text": "The other half never read anything in their lives.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 325,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "calls"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a3c152d2c160dfed",
      "text": "On the air I call them our visitors. It keeps it friendly.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 329,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "visitors"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a75c7f370b3629f3",
      "text": "Off the air I don't call them anything.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 330,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "visitors"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "357153cc24cbf51d",
      "text": "Every one, on reel. Twelve years of them.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 334,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "tape"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ef7a39269e528490",
      "text": "Except one. September of '81, a boy called in. I've never played it back.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 335,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "tape"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "281daafd0a94d01a",
      "text": "I wasn't on the air that night. The station was off.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 336,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "tape"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ecc59550da45471d",
      "text": "Record's ending.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 338,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "tape"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2965d89d13a00665",
      "text": "You heard him too.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 342,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "boy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "466b8eed89cf1d9e",
      "text": "I put the receiver down and tried the line again. Dial tone. Just a phone.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 344,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "boy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f58484cccf41a7b6",
      "text": "I haven't played that one. I told you.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 346,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "boy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "80386b410ffeb2a1",
      "text": "I wrote this one down.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/caliche.ts",
          "line": 348,
          "kind": "static-npc",
          "character": "EARL",
          "topic": "boy"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
